= Vilnius Incorporation

The government have put forward a motion On Assuming State Authority over the Vilnius Region in pursuant of the resolution passed by the Seimas of **<span style="color: #D00;">Central Lithuanian</span>** wherein the region is to be annexed by the **<span style="color: #DDDDDD;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">ish</span>** state.

The motion have received broad support from the Sejm and is guaranteed to pass, our partners and party members expects us to vote for the motion, voting against the motion could easily frame our party as against **<span style="color: #DDDDDD;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">ish</span>** national interest.

- @vote_yes: Vote yes, for the incorporation of Vilnius.
- @vote_no: Vote no, against the incorporation of Vilnius.
- @abstain: Abstain from the vote.
  
@vote_no
