face-image: CelebrationofVilniusIncorporation.png
  
The motion easily passes the Sejm, and **<span style="color: #DDDDDD;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">ish</span>**  Nationalist are in uproar. The West are displeased at our incorporation.

Vilnius remained the declared capital of **<span style="color: #FFB81C;">Lit</span><span style="color: #046A38;">hua</span><span style="color: #BE3A34;">nia</span>**, though the **<span style="color: #FFB81C;">Lit</span><span style="color: #046A38;">huan</span><span style="color: #BE3A34;">ian</span>** government continued to operate from Kaunas. Refusing to recognize **<span style="color: #DDDDDD;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">and</span>**'s claim to the region, **<span style="color: #FFB81C;">Lit</span><span style="color: #046A38;">hua</span><span style="color: #BE3A34;">nia</span>** severed communications with **<span style="color: #DDDDDD;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">and</span>** , effectively collapsing all hopes of improving diplomatic relations.
  
